1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,400
I adopted Biscuit three years ago.

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,000
He is a very happy dog with a very matted coat.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,800
I tried brushing him at home, but he hated it.

4
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:14,600
Every groomer I called had a three week wait.

5
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:18,200
A neighbour told me about Maple Lane Dog Grooming.

6
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:22,000
I booked an appointment online on a Sunday night.

7
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,800
They texted me back before eight the next morning.

8
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:29,600
The woman on the phone asked about his coat and his nerves.

9
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:33,400
She said they would take it slowly with him.

10
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:37,000
I dropped him off at nine on Wednesday.

11
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,800
They called me before they did any shaving.

12
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:44,600
They showed me photos of the mats and explained the options.

13
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:48,400
I chose the gentle de-matting, not the full shave.

14
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:52,000
No surprises on the bill. It matched the quote.

15
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,800
I picked him up at three.

16
00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:59,600
He came out with a soft, fluffy, shiny coat.

17
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:03,400
From matted to mirror shine in one visit.

18
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:07,200
Biscuit was wagging so hard he nearly fell over.

19
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:11,000
My daughter did not recognise him at first.

20
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:14,800
The groomer even sent a photo halfway through.

21
00:01:14,800 --> 00:01:18,600
That is the kind of thing that makes me trust a place.

22
00:01:18,600 --> 00:01:22,400
I have booked him in every six weeks since.

23
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:26,200
The reminders come by text, which I love.

24
00:01:26,200 --> 00:01:30,000
Rescheduling took two taps on my phone.

25
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:33,800
He used to shake in the car on the way there.

26
00:01:33,800 --> 00:01:37,600
Now he pulls me toward the front door.

27
00:01:37,600 --> 00:01:41,400
If your dog has a coat that needs rescuing, book a groom.

28
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:45,200
Ask for the gentle de-matting.

29
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:49,000
Honestly, I wish I had called them years ago.

30
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:52,000
Biscuit says thank you too.

31
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:55,000
Maple Lane Dog Grooming.

32
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:58,000
Book online, any time.
